      "translations": [
        "I love famous vintage clothes. Last week I spotted one online.",
        "It was white, really nice, and not expensive — only three hundred kuai.",
        "I bought it straight away. Three days later it arrived.",
        "I tried it on, and there was one problem: it was too small!",
        "I called the seller I know online. He said: “No problem, I'll send you a bigger one.”",
        "Now I've got the bigger one. I love it, and my friends think it looks great too."
